  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1ea1c20b3282e824ab245b1cc794a591, type: 3}
  m_Name: day1Phonecall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SubtitleData
  lines:
  - time: 0
    text: '[Phone Ringing]'
  - time: 10.6
    text: Hello? Hello, hello?
  - time: 12.8
    text: I was told to record a message for you, for your first day at the office.
  - time: 16.6
    text: I used to work in this exact cubicle, you know, before I was caught, uh,
      lacking.
  - time: 21.6
    text: 'But yeah, I''m supposed to help introduce you to the company, get you
      through your first week. '
  - time: 27.1
    text: Just do your work, Nothing too much to worry about.
  - time: 30.7
    text: "Uh, let\u2019s see, first there\u2019s an introductory greeting from the
      company, which I\u2019m supposed to read."
  - time: 36.3
    text: "Uh, it\u2019s kind of a legal thing, you know."
  - time: 38.3
    text: " Um, \u201CWelcome to Freddy Fazbear\u2019s Legal Office , a magical place
      for lawsuits, where ethical violations and moral dilemmas come to life."
  - time: 42.7
    text: where ethical violations and moral dilemmas come to life.
  - time: 46.3
    text: So Uh, your coworkers, they get a bit quirky during the day.
  - time: 51.7
    text: They wander around, and bother you sometimes.
  - time: 54
    text: And if they catch you slacking, they will snitch on you
  - time: 57.2
    text: So uh, If you don't want to get fired, you probably don't want to get caught.
  - time: 62.3
    text: 'I''ve found it effective to hide under the desk when they come into your
      cubicle. '
  - time: 66.2
    text: And your boss, he's even worse.
  - time: 68.2
    text: Don't tell anyone, but I found out he installed a productivity monitor
      on the computers.
  - time: 72.9
    text: Just make sure you keep up your typing activity so he doesn't run over
      and fire you.
  - time: 77.6
    text: 'Now that might sound bad, I know. '
  - time: 79.6
    text: But don't worry, no one does any actual work here.
  - time: 81.9
    text: In fact, to ensure I did no work, I hacked into the security system
  - time: 85.6
    text: so I could see where these people are, so I can anticipate them.
  - time: 89.2
    text: 'I''d recommend you to monitor them to do the same. '
  - time: 91.9
    text: But hey, nothing bad ever happens on the first day.
  - time: 95.7
    text: "I\u2019ll chat with you tomorrow."
  - time: 97
    text: 'Uh, check those cameras, and remember to hide under the desk only if they
      get over to your cubicle. '
  - time: 103
    text: 'Gotta keep up your productivity at the desk, not under. '
  - time: 107
    text: 
